	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"人気のKMF“紅蓮弐式”が豪華なロイヤルコーティングVer.となって登場 全身、煌びやかなスペシャルコーティング仕様 右腕の輻射波動機構はそのギミックを再現 コクピットはクリアカラーで再現、コクピットハッチは開閉可能 カレンのフィギュア（立ち姿、着座の2種）が付属"
		],
		"en": [
			"The popular KMF \"Guren 2 Type\" is now available as a luxurious royal coating version. The entire body has a glittering special coating. The radiation wave mechanism on the right arm reproduces its gimmick. The cockpit is reproduced in clear color, and the cockpit hatch can be opened and closed. A Karen figure (standing and seated) is included."
		]
	},
